WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
AI reconstruction: a swordfish approaches small fish.

00:01.000 --> 00:02.000
The bill sweeps beside prey. A strike can stun or injure a fish.

00:02.000 --> 00:03.000
The other fish scatter as the swordfish moves toward slowed prey.

00:03.000 --> 00:03.500
The mouth takes in a small fish; it is not swallowed through the bill.

